   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to reduce vulnerability of young people in border zones to HIV infection and other STIs. One of the main actitivites is to increase access to information on HIV prevention and SRHR. The programme has also strong emphasis on capacity building for local health structures in border zones.</narrative>
